<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document Layout</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            margin: 20px;
            color: #000;
            line-height: 1.3;
            background-color: #fff;
        }
        .container {
            display: flex;
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .left-col {
            flex: 1;
            padding-right: 20px;
        }
        .right-col {
            width: 140px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .eng {
            margin: 4px 0 2px 0;
        }
        .chn {
            margin: 0 0 6px 0;
        }
        .chn u {
            text-decoration: underline;
            text-underline-offset: 2px;
            text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
        }
        .hl-orange { background-color: #fce4b3; }
        .hl-green { background-color: #c9e8ca; }
        .hl-pink { background-color: #f7c3c5; }
        .bold-under {
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: underline;
            text-underline-offset: 2px;
            display: block;
            margin-top: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }
        .vocab-block {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .vocab-line {
            margin-bottom: 1px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="left-col">
            <div class="eng">Ask yourself what loneliness means to you.</div>
            <div class="chn"><u>问问自己孤独对你意味着什么。</u></div>

            <div class="eng">If you're telling yourself that loneliness is a terrible thing, that it's dangerous to alone, and that you can't fend for yourself in life, you have a problem.</div>
            <div class="chn"><u>如果你告诉自己孤独是一件可怕的事情，孤独是危险的，你不能在生活中照顾自己，你就有问题了。</u></div>

            <div class="eng">Therefore, you must change these irrational ideas for more <span class="hl-orange">rational</span> and realistic ones.</div>
            <div class="chn"><u>所以，你一定要把这些非理性的想法，换成更<span class="hl-orange">理性</span>、更现实的想法。</u></div>

            <span class="bold-under">Spend time with you</span>
            <div class="chn bold-under" style="margin-top: 2px; display: inline-block;">与你共度时光</div>

            <div class="eng">Force yourself to spend time alone.</div>
            <div class="chn"><u>强迫自己花时间独处。</u></div>

            <div class="eng"><span class="hl-green">In order to</span> change, you must not only act on a <span class="hl-orange">mental</span> or cognitive level, but also on a behavioral level.</div>
            <div class="chn"><u>为了改变，你不仅要有<span class="hl-orange">精神</span>或认知层面上的意识，还要在行为层面上行动。</u></div>

            <div class="eng"><span class="hl-orange">Program</span> <span class="hl-orange">entire</span> weekends alone with your own company.</div>
            <div class="chn"><u>计划整个周末单独由自己陪着自己。</u></div>

            <div class="eng">Enjoy a book or a movie if you want but avoid social media.</div>
            <div class="chn"><u>如果你愿意，享受一本书或一部电影，但避免社交媒体。</u></div>

            <div class="eng">Go to the movies, to the beach, to the mountains, alone.</div>
            <div class="chn"><u>去看电影，去海滩，去山上，一个人。</u></div>

            <div class="eng">Take a trip without any company.</div>
            <div class="chn"><u>在没有任何陪伴的情况下进行一次旅行。</u></div>

            <div class="eng">When you do this for long enough, you'll realize that you survived, that your fears weren't real, and that you've met your own true self and now you know yourself better.</div>
            <div class="chn"><u>当你这样做足够长的时间后，你会意识到你幸存了下来，你的恐惧不是真的，你已经遇到了真正的自己，现在你更了解自己了。</u></div>

            <span class="bold-under">Connect with others</span>
            <div class="chn bold-under" style="margin-top: 2px; display: inline-block;">与他人联系</div>

            <div class="eng">Manage your time so you surround yourself with people.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="right-col">
            <div class="vocab-block">
                <div class="vocab-line"><span class="hl-orange">rational</span>:adj.</div>
                <div class="vocab-line">〔人〕有理</div>
                <div class="vocab-line">性的，理智</div>
                <div class="vocab-line">的;能作出理</div>
                <div class="vocab-line">智决定的，</div>
                <div class="vocab-line">理性的</div>
            </div>

            <div class="vocab-block">
                <div class="vocab-line"><span class="hl-orange">mental</span>:adj.精</div>
                <div class="vocab-line">神状态的</div>
                <div class="vocab-line"><span class="hl-green">mental illness</span></div>
                <div class="vocab-line">;思想的; 精神</div>
                <div class="vocab-line">的; 思考的; 智</div>
                <div class="vocab-line">力的</div>
            </div>

            <div class="vocab-block">
                <div class="vocab-line"><span class="hl-orange">program</span> : n.</div>
                <div class="vocab-line">计算机〕程</div>
                <div class="vocab-line">序:</div>
                <div class="vocab-line">V.计划; 规</div>
                <div class="vocab-line">划; 安排</div>
            </div>

            <div class="vocab-block">
                <div class="vocab-line"><span class="hl-orange">entire</span>:adj.</div>
                <div class="vocab-line">全部的; 整个</div>
                <div class="vocab-line">的</div>
            </div>

            <div class="vocab-block">
                <div class="vocab-line"><span class="hl-green">同义词:</span></div>
                <div class="vocab-line">whole</div>
            </div>

            <div class="vocab-block" style="margin-top: 25px;">
                <div class="vocab-line"><span class="hl-pink">为了...（目</span></div>
                <div class="vocab-line"><span class="hl-pink">的）</span></div>
                <div class="vocab-line" style="margin-top: 8px;"><span class="hl-pink">短语:</span></div>
                <div class="vocab-line" style="margin-top: 12px;"><span class="hl-pink">in order to</span></div>
                <div class="vocab-line" style="margin-top: 22px;"><span class="hl-pink">so as to</span></div>
                <div class="vocab-line" style="margin-top: 22px;"><span class="hl-pink">so that</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
